   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "WHY THIS IS THE MISSING HALF\n\nEvery number the matrix produces today answers \"what is\nMISSING?\".\n\nNothing answers \"does this scenario SERVE anything?\" \u2014 a\nscenario citing nothing resolvable is silently absent from\ncovered{}, and no gap is reported for it.\n\nWe already learned this on the gather side: recall=1.0 with\nprecision=0.00 is a real state.",
   "originalText": "WHY THIS IS THE MISSING HALF\n\nEvery number the matrix produces today answers \"what is\nMISSING?\".\n\nNothing answers \"does this scenario SERVE anything?\" \u2014 a\nscenario citing nothing resolvable is silently absent from\ncovered{}, and no gap is reported for it.\n\nWe already learned this on the gather side: recall=1.0 with\nprecision=0.00 is a real state.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": false
  },
