   "type": "text",
   "text": "CONSTRAINT I3 HOLDS\n\nimplement = exactly ONE LLM call.\n\nBoth counters are pure functions over data already in the bank \u2014\na dict comprehension and a token match. _tokens() already exists\nin coverage.py.\n\nZero new LLM calls. Zero new storage.",
   "originalText": "CONSTRAINT I3 HOLDS\n\nimplement = exactly ONE LLM call.\n\nBoth counters are pure functions over data already in the bank \u2014\na dict comprehension and a token match. _tokens() already exists\nin coverage.py.\n\nZero new LLM calls. Zero new storage.",
