   "type": "text",
   "text": "ONCE per implement pass over the merged set \u2014 never per scenario, never per turn.  The same shape as every gate we already ship: a cheap deterministic filter in front, the calibrated judge only on what is left.",
   "originalText": "ONCE per implement pass over the merged set \u2014 never per scenario, never per turn.  The same shape as every gate we already ship: a cheap deterministic filter in front, the calibrated judge only on what is left.",
